1Sa 7:1 , They of Kirjath-jearim bring the ark into the house of Abinadab, and sanctify Eleazar, his son to keep it;
1Sa 7:2 , After twenty years
1Sa 7:3 , the Israelites, by Samuel's means, solemnly repent at Mizpeh;
1Sa 7:7 , While Samuel prays and sacrifices, the Lord discomfits the Philistines by thunder at Eben-ezer;
1Sa 7:13 , The Philistines are subdued;
1Sa 7:15 , Samuel judges Israel.
